flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b8babe,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef friction fill:#f6f7f7,stroke:#3a3e44,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef broken fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c4362b,stroke-width:2px,color:#c4362b;
  S1["1. The owner starts the container with a password:<br/>APP_PASSWORD=... docker compose up -d.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. Without a password, or with fewer than 8<br/>characters, the server does not start and says<br/>why.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Opening the app without a login goes to the<br/>login page.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. A wrong password comes back with 'Wrong<br/>password.' and the caret in the field.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. After 5 wrong tries the page says 'Wait 30<br/>seconds and try again.'; during the wait the<br/>right password gets the same answer, with no<br/>countdown.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S6["6. The right password lands on the empty Dashboard<br/>with Add bookmark, Import and How to save.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. On the phone the same login, then Dashboard,<br/>Inbox and Folders tabs, the Settings gear, the<br/>search pill and the plus.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. Light and dark follow the system; the bulb<br/>switches and the choice is kept per browser.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S9["9. Password managers fill the login: the form<br/>carries a fixed user name.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
  S8 --> S9
